  delay 15/2;
  perform MagnetOff ();
  unbox drying as beads in
  perform EluteDNA beads
*)

(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the binding, the settling on the
   magnet and the air-dry each take the upper end of their windows, which
   their boxes accept, but the eluates reach the cold block up to 41.25
   minutes after the beads were added:

     Typing error: Variable `warm` is unboxed with grade
       `[{10; MagnetOn; 5; RemoveSupernatant; AddEthanol; 1; RemoveEthanol;
       AddEthanol; 0.75; RemoveEthanol; RemoveResidualEthanol; 5; MagnetOff;
       EluteDNA; 3; MagnetOn; 2.5}, ...]` accumulated since it was bound,
       which is not below its box grade `[{0}, {40}]`
*)
